@prefix bat-labeling: <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-labeling#>.
@prefix bat-locations: <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-locations#>.
@prefix bat-materials: <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-materials#>.
@prefix bat-metals: <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals#>.
@prefix bat-performance: <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-performance#>.
@prefix bat-statuses: <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#>.
@prefix eudpp: <https://w3id.org/eudpp#>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
